{"result":{"api_status":null,"cache":{},"canonical_url":"https://github.com/rxpelle/kdp-scout","error_class":null,"http_status":200,"item_ids":["github:rxpelle/kdp-scout@92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee"],"payload":{"latest_commit":{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258741235?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nanookclaw","id":258741235,"login":"nanookclaw","node_id":"U_kgDOD2wT8w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nanookclaw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/commits/92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z","email":"nanook@agentmail.to","name":"nanookclaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add output option for reports and exports (#8)\n\n* feat: add output option for reports and exports\n\n* test: add real-engine integration tests for output file capture\n\nThe existing CLI output tests mock ReportingEngine and emit via the\nbuiltin print(), so they never exercise the actual Rich console\nrendering that --output relies on (contextlib.redirect_stdout capturing\nrich.console.Console). Add two tests that run the real engine against a\nseeded temp database and assert the rendered Rich table lands in the\nfile, plus the empty-DB zero-row boundary.\n\nAlso fix the existing mock-based tests, which assumed Click >=8.2's\nalways-separate stderr and failed under the project's pinned Click\n8.1.8. A make_runner() helper requests mix_stderr=False on 8.1.x and\nfalls back to the default runner on 8.2+, keeping the suite green on\nboth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nanook <nanookclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Randy Pellegrini <rxpelle@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/git/trees/387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rxpelle/kdp-scout/git/commits/92131151378f83142ac214ed2eca7474c405efee","verification":{"payload":"tree 387cb3b8a67a75f6f86320b4b0b58f80765aeb87\nparent 61c320fbd85dcfcb633cb1526294392c621de3af\nauthor nanookclaw <nanook@agentmail.to> 1780702088 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780702088 -0700\n\nfeat: add output option for reports and exports (#8)\n\n* feat: add output option for reports and exports\n\n* test: add real-engine integration tests for output file capture\n\nThe existing CLI output tests mock ReportingEngine and emit via the\nbuiltin print(), so they never exercise the actual Rich console\nrendering that --output relies on (contextlib.redirect_stdout capturing\nrich.console.Console). Add two tests that run the real engine against a\nseeded temp database and assert the rendered Rich table lands in the\nfile, plus the empty-DB zero-row boundary.\n\nAlso fix the existing mock-based tests, which assumed Click >=8.2's\nalways-separate stderr and failed under the project's pinned Click\n8.1.8. A make_runner() helper requests mix_stderr=False on 8.1.x and\nfalls back to the default runner on 8.2+, keeping the suite green on\nboth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nanook <nanookclaw@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Randy Pellegrini <rxpelle@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqI1uICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWyIQAD3Ve64IcsrDvjVBOBpbDh03\n1WiHbTojOEbC/Uq+bQueFKm1fdZ9MV5Xj5l26rR0NJEfO8rj08WayWlTY2mlTvfF\ndN6v9hKzs9Rn8EKLXNCnlLQ50eovzZjCE5QEwVxQRSAYwoss637DGau9kd9gMmJa\nj1gyQmxPhI0D0waxyZKDoQLE3CRpKdQTAj8dk9tc9kOsETMCwRp1Bm1sq0emGGYC\nCHiPJjZJ3WiBSgQfjAFX5NAo1Jz46vFDwVwNzXzUBO1IDgP8Ig3Ib022KlugHY15\n8Ws8gw5njOUo96dfAF7/4073WV1Ptq6YWzcq32SkKW2EWZeA8joyJbX0n4EdaQlN\nni1P5x3ovRDsuqqtUiKZX4JlX4wjOGIeedervu0O/rxWYCvc6jXzMh4KnzhfO6oK\nYoX7bt3g4/p8ajZBNt5gaDsfhT3s2Jz5CaL7VlYPh4rwtuGPw5aIWiT5vZ1eUHQa\naBL47i8FzFA8kAtxFWm0Cy+AsgIVgB155G2eZI5mQI/Ardt8DZcvHMteZutFWAxQ\nSyYRJ2sAGPZqYTvQlA4/pYqdFERO7rSvQ9moRbPL4raZawLNZTzRILIfJxEmV/Fs\nuJdCFuGRCixvjScMQ7F0rMraDEBo/JmLKQYIF7pISTkKhQPu9xGNb29sFZIwhSXe\nIxOtnpaw6XZA8qPzHFfx\n=r8GL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-05T23:28:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur